#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:3
msgid "Advanced Pixel for Barion"
msgstr "Barion Pixel pentru WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: advanced-pixel-for-barion.php:4
